<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21087" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρῠ-άζω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρυάσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			, aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀν-εβρύαξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					602
				</span></i>
			, other wise only pres.and
				impf.:—<i>swell, teem</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρποῖσι β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>H.</u>
					53.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				33.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπόταν γε [Ζεὺς] βρυάζων οἶκον
				ἐσέλθῃ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				73.4
			</span></i>; of a lioness, <i>to be pregnant</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				491
			</span></i>; <i>bubble up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέπας ἀφρῷ βρυάζον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tim.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>wax wanton</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				878
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁ λίθος οἶδε βρυάζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.756
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Aemil.
			</span></i>): c. dat., <i>revel in</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				181
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαίρειν καὶ β</span>. prob. l.
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				600
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				605
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ γυναῖκες ἐβρύαζον ταῖς Δωρίαις
					στολαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Duris
					50
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ποτοῦ λαμπρῶς ἤδη -οντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					5.16
				</span></i>
			.</div>
